  "id": "usgs-htmc",
  "dct_title_s": "USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection (HTMC) includes maps in GeoTIFF and Geospatial PDF/GeoPDF formats. The HTMC provides a comprehensive digital repository of all scales and editions of topographic maps published by the USGS since the inception of the topographic mapping program in 1884. These maps are also available via https://ngmdb.usgs.gov/topoview/viewer/ in other formats."
  ],
